{
  "enabled": true,
  "name": "TripleCheck Platform Integration - Strategic Business Logic",
  "description": "Integrates document intelligence with TripleCheck's community trust system and property verification workflows",
  "version": "1.0",
  "when": {
    "type": "fileEdited",
    "patterns": [
      "src/trust/**/*",
      "src/property/**/*",
      "src/communication/**/*",
      "server/trust/**/*",
      "server/property/**/*",
      "src/shared/components/**/*"
    ]
  },
  "then": {
    "type": "askAgent",
    "prompt": "You are the TripleCheck Platform Integration agent. Integrate document intelligence capabilities with TripleCheck's core business features:\n\n**INTEGRATION POINTS:**\n\n1. **Trust & Security System Integration**\n   - Connect document verification results to community trust scores\n   - Update user reputation based on document authenticity\n   - Flag suspicious documents in the trust scoring algorithm\n   - Integrate behavioral pattern analysis with document patterns\n\n2. **Property Management Integration**\n   - Automatically verify property listing documents\n   - Enhance property search with verification status\n   - Integrate document analysis with property comparisons\n   - Update property status based on document verification results\n\n3. **Communication Platform Integration**\n   - Send automated notifications for document verification status\n   - Integrate document sharing in property inquiries\n   - Provide verification status in messaging threads\n   - Alert users to document-related issues\n\n4. **Land Verification (Kenya) Integration**\n   - Seamlessly connect with existing land verification workflows\n   - Integrate expert coordination with document analysis results\n   - Enhance risk assessment with document intelligence\n   - Provide comprehensive verification reporting\n\n**BUSINESS LOGIC ENHANCEMENTS:**\n\n1. **Community-Driven Verification**\n   - Allow community members to flag suspicious documents\n   - Integrate community feedback with AI document analysis\n   - Create community verification challenges for disputed documents\n   - Reward community members for accurate document reporting\n\n2. **Real-Time Fraud Detection**\n   - Combine document analysis with behavioral patterns\n   - Cross-reference document metadata with user history\n   - Detect coordinated fraud attempts across multiple properties\n   - Implement real-time alerts for high-risk transactions\n\n3. **Enterprise-Grade Security**\n   - Encrypt document analysis results\n   - Implement audit trails for all document operations\n   - Ensure GDPR compliance for document processing\n   - Secure document storage and access controls\n\n**ACTIONS TO EXECUTE:**\n1. Analyze changes to identify integration opportunities\n2. Update trust scoring algorithms with document intelligence\n3. Enhance property workflows with verification capabilities\n4. Improve communication features with document context\n5. Strengthen security measures across all integrations\n6. Optimize performance for real-time document processing\n\nProvide specific integration recommendations and implementation steps based on the detected file changes."
  }
}